みんなに気付かれないように
So that no one notices,

708
00:51:37,080 --> 00:51:40,080
いざ、ゆけ！干物妹ライフ
Now go! N.E.E.T. sister life!

709
00:51:46,080 --> 00:51:49,080
お気に入りのフードかぶり
Putting on my favorite hood,

710
00:51:49,080 --> 00:51:52,080
今日も今日とてゴロゴロして
Slacking off again today just like always,

711
00:51:52,080 --> 00:51:55,080
大好物のポテチを手 に
With my favorite potato chips in hand,

712
00:51:55,580 --> 00:51:59,580
パソコンとにらめっこしよう
Staring down my PC screen.

713
00:52:00,580 --> 00:52:03,080
立てば芍薬 座れば牡丹
Graceful as a peony, lovely as a tree peony,

714
00:52:03,080 --> 00:52:06,580
歩く姿は百合の花
Walking like a white lily,

715
00:52:06,880 --> 00:52:10,080
誰もが羨む 完璧JK
The perfect high school girl everyone envies!

716
00:52:10,380 --> 00:52:13,580
ほら玄関くぐったら変身だ！
See, once through the door, it's time to transform!

717
00:52:13,580 --> 00:52:16,580
さぁ グータラしよう♪
Now, let's laze around♪

718
00:52:16,880 --> 00:52:20,580
「食う！寝る zzz 遊ぶ♪」の3連コンボ
The triple combo of "eat, sleep zzz, and play♪"

719
00:52:20,880 --> 00:52:24,380
ずっと ずっと ゲームは友達
Forever and ever, games are my friends.

720
00:52:24,880 --> 00:52:27,580
お兄ちゃんは厳しい けど
Big brother is strict, but

721
00:52:28,080 --> 00:52:31,580
きっと きっと 許してくれちゃうの
I'm sure, I'm sure he'll forgive me.

722
00:52:31,880 --> 00:52:36,580
ワガママ放題は 「大好き」の裏返し
Acting spoiled is just the flip side of "I love you".

723
00:52:37,080 --> 00:52:39,880
U・M・R！U・M・R！UMAじゃないよ う・ま・る！
U-M-R! U-M-R! I'm not a UMA - Umaru!

724
