外では猫をかぶり
Putting on a facade outside,

725
00:52:46,880 --> 00:52:49,880
今日も明日も演じるのです
I'll keep acting today and tomorrow too.

726
00:52:50,080 --> 00:52:53,080
大好評の笑顔を武器に
Using my popular smile as a weapon,

727
00:52:53,380 --> 00:52:56,580
トモダチにバレないように
So my friends won't find out.

728
00:52:57,080 --> 00:52:59,580
立てば2頭身 座ればまんまる
Standing, two-headed; sitting, round,

729
