天真爛漫スマイルで
With an innocent, carefree smile,

749
00:54:24,580 --> 00:54:28,580
ぎゅっと ぎゅっと 心をつかんじゃうの
I'll capture your heart tightly, tightly.

750
00:54:29,080 --> 00:54:33,580
やりたい放題は 信頼の裏返し？
Doing whatever I want is a sign of trust?

751
00:54:33,880 --> 00:54:36,580
U・M・R！U・M・R！UMAじゃないよ う・ま・る！
U-M-R! U-M-R! I'm not a UMA - Umaru!

752
00:54:37,080 --> 00:54:39,880
U・M・R！U・M・R！UMAじゃないよ う・ま・る！
